          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ca gicu kimaze kuduga hejuru y’ihema, Miriyamu agihagaze ngaho yuzura imibembe, yera derere. Aroni ahindukiye ngo amurabe abona yuzuye imibembe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na we aca abarira Mose ati: “Ndakwinginze nyakwubahwa, ntushishikare kuduharurako icaha cacu twakoze mu bujuju bwacu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntumureke ngo amere nk’icavutse gipfuye kikiva mu nda ya nyina catanguye kubora.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
